description:
Implement `useTransitionFilter` — a hook that uses `useTransition` to defer expensive list filtering, keeping UI responsive while the filter updates.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { query, setQuery, filtered, isPending } = useTransitionFilter(
  items,
  (item, q) => item.name.includes(q)
);
// isPending is true while filtering is deferred
```

